          "note": [
            "January 1 1997, Malmöhus county and Kristianstads county were united and formed a new county, named Skåne county.   January 1 1998, Göteborgs och Bohus county,  Älvsborgs county and Skaraborgs county were united and formed a new county, named Västra Götalands county. At the same time, Habo and Mullsjö municipalities, that formerly belonged to Skaraborgs county, were transferred to Jönköpings county.",
